    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: a4af743dce557631753fc12972c1b54ee9292ff9 -->\nDelta review (merge of main since e1ff076d): clean.\n\nOnly commit since the last review is the merge of main (4827fde6). Checked: `git diff upstream/main --stat` lists only the PR's 7 files (3 machines, posting.rs, tests, decision record), so nothing from main is dropped. Both conflicts (`posting.rs` MACHINES, `tests/machine.rs` expectations) keep both sides in the same order: main's 770M+ and 1100M+ first, then 24R, xsTECH Pro, xsTECH. The array and the expectations list stay aligned (the test zips them and asserts equal length). No safety check lost.\n\nTests (debug): app `machine` 32/32, `tormach_routers` 5/5. `clippy -p camcraft-app --lib` plus both test targets with `-D warnings`: clean.\n",
